                                                target that concern. If you have any active blemishes, you
                                                can
                                                get as close as possible, but avoid stamping directly on any
                                                active breakouts on the skin.</li>
                                            <img src="https://qureskincaredns.com/new/assets/faq_refill.png" alt="" class="py-2">
                                            <li>Repeat 2-3 passes for better results.</li>
                                            <li>Take any left over serum and pat into your face and neck so
                                                your
